{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/wellness_screen.dart:offset-69806", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/wellness_screen.dart", "location": "offset-69806", "text": "'No day stands apart from the other six once we account for '\n'having checked all seven.'", "sha256": "6c5f205d90a12fae336861ad64031c2febe204b782dc8798b8017431994245f2", "kind": "dart", "start": 69806, "end": 69911, "line": 1759}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/wellness_screen.dart:offset-70594", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/wellness_screen.dart", "location": "offset-70594", "text": "'${_weekdayName(day)}s: readiness runs '\n'${delta.abs().round()} $direction than your overall median'", "sha256": "92dae4059d797a22b322fefbbb9a9d0d0ae7185667e8e52392aff1c82dcbc7f7", "kind": "dart", "start": 70594, "end": 70711, "line": 1779}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/wellness_screen.dart:offset-70775", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/wellness_screen.dart", "location": "offset-70775", "text": "'From $n of them. A weekday is not a cause — it is a container '\n'for what you do on it. Nothing here is advice.'", "sha256": "c04a13e5878d543c15c391bec072496f2d930c18ac74ec723c7287a21e42a5b6", "kind": "dart", "start": 70775, "end": 70904, "line": 1782}
