{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart:offset-5750", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart", "location": "offset-5750", "text": "'Nothing has landed for this day yet'", "sha256": "7bdbf8533261bf5fe22f74b81d32697d7f065f7409cad6235b0b636d59e29acf", "kind": "dart", "start": 5750, "end": 5787, "line": 169}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart:offset-5837", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart", "location": "offset-5837", "text": "'The sweep compares a day against the ones before it, and this day has '\n'no value to compare. Nothing about it is unusual because nothing '\n'about it is known.'", "sha256": "f72601866a071c2de9143766b93ea7ba622a64b54386d83fc53c83d64f19c147", "kind": "dart", "start": 5837, "end": 6030, "line": 171}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart:offset-6213", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart", "location": "offset-6213", "text": "'Still learning your usual'", "sha256": "09cda721d4be14712720dbb72d2f11403a6b81e522b015ecf1f1f1685c318866", "kind": "dart", "start": 6213, "end": 6240, "line": 178}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart:offset-6328", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart", "location": "offset-6328", "text": "'Unusual only means anything against a range, and there '\n'${d.longestHistory == 1 ? '", "sha256": "68cd6e93094cd9921f83cc1c76e09870d72a4539f176b82a8e0850fec3ac530e", "kind": "dart", "start": 6328, "end": 6430, "line": 180}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart:offset-6518", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart", "location": "offset-6518", "text": "'} of history behind this '\n'one. The sweep starts at $kSweepMinHistory.'", "sha256": "026b7ed79687523a19a7262a38fd88de439a9b98e44801f6a8709e689b56ab03", "kind": "dart", "start": 6518, "end": 6607, "line": 182}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart:offset-7010", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart", "location": "offset-7010", "text": "'Nothing stood out'", "sha256": "b754b04de609477538c49e1c9617f51177983569324256e43922c1adf89804a6", "kind": "dart", "start": 7010, "end": 7029, "line": 192}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart:offset-7080", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart", "location": "offset-7080", "text": "'Every metric with enough history sat inside the range your own days '\n'have set. That is the normal answer, and it is a complete one.'", "sha256": "9971e7fa766049c55b81f8fbc70e619f9f10b00cffe8df3b06ea2b361f299cd6", "kind": "dart", "start": 7080, "end": 7231, "line": 194}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart:offset-7821", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/what_changed.dart", "location": "offset-7821", "text": "'Measured against your own trailing days, in your own units, with the '\n'window attached — so you can disbelieve it. Nothing here is a cause '\n'and nothing here is a diagnosis.'", "sha256": "b179f063249fb1b8f2c2edc1f61310f2f3c98611366a99d5b0b5ecc5cf819f96", "kind": "dart", "start": 7821, "end": 8022, "line": 216}
