{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart:offset-9891", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart", "location": "offset-9891", "text": "'Reps × load over the sets you logged with a weight. '", "sha256": "eea9d8c084f14fcf3d103f4f88e139be76258bb5a2dccb977a75fcc3a7c2de19", "kind": "dart", "start": 9891, "end": 9945, "line": 250}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart:offset-10056", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart", "location": "offset-10056", "text": "'Sets logged without one are not in it, so '\n'this is a floor rather than a total. '", "sha256": "61183c0a0cf89c1c644c9cbcd989c5cd6baa2196824e1344ae21b812c9921c5b", "kind": "dart", "start": 10056, "end": 10164, "line": 253}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart:offset-10255", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart", "location": "offset-10255", "text": "'Exact for what you typed and worthless across exercises — '\n'kept out of strain and recovery for that reason.'", "sha256": "8e1f7ab88118eb6d191258f5617bbc58acf420d57e8611f1a681ee5c66b7c57c", "kind": "dart", "start": 10255, "end": 10386, "line": 257}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart:offset-11593", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart", "location": "offset-11593", "text": "'Your last 7 days of load are '\n'$ratio× your usual six weeks, and your resting '\n'heart rate was above your usual on ${o.nightsElevated} of '\n'${o.nightsConsidered} nights.'", "sha256": "613777b92c9f86876dd87eddbba98303c01edfe228a9e49955090f35e13f3e6b", "kind": "dart", "start": 11593, "end": 11809, "line": 287}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart:offset-11856", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart", "location": "offset-11856", "text": "'Two measurements that happen to point the same way. Illness, travel, '\n'altitude, alcohol and a run of poor sleep all produce this same '\n'pair, and nothing here can tell them apart.'", "sha256": "1c061748f6860171a17ae2a5296816acc9d8a11aae65ca0b4bb7346d0cc0c0fd", "kind": "dart", "start": 11856, "end": 12068, "line": 292}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart:offset-12323", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart", "location": "offset-12323", "text": "'No training load yet'", "sha256": "e894cdd47e534b0e4e463212b0cd5a6eee825f8ec9fe905b8cf559f9b5ec1ba8", "kind": "dart", "start": 12323, "end": 12345, "line": 304}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart:offset-12424", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/workout_screen.dart", "location": "offset-12424", "text": "'Fitness and fatigue are 42-day and 7-day averages. They need '\n'about two weeks of sessions.'", "sha256": "253f05ecff4bd7dd5eb6a96b2a973495b1edf2116780e08ba8b0b5222799a7b9", "kind": "dart", "start": 12424, "end": 12538, "line": 307}
